MCSKIP MT,<>
MCINS %.
The third temporary variable is the depth of nesting, counting the
call it belongs to.
MCDEF LEVEL; AS <(%T3. %A1.)>
LEVEL LEVEL LEVEL bottom;;;
LEVEL top;
The first is the number of arguments the call had. Each call has its
own set, so an inner call cannot disturb an outer one.
MCDEF OUTER; AS <outer=%T1. [%A1.] outer still=%T1.>
MCDEF INNER,; AS <inner=%T1.>
OUTER INNER a,b;;
